celld-campfire-bench

Independent chat-runtime experiments inspired by Basecamp Campfire.
The runtime patch adapts celld Worker dispatch, scheduling, and dependency
configuration to run the benchmark application as Rust Wasm or native Rust.
The captured runtime sources contain these modifications.

